.\" Manpage for matazero
.TH MATAZERO 1 "August 2026" "matazero 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
matazero \- Image Intelligence Toolkit for Ethical OSINT and Digital Forensics

.SH SYNOPSIS
.B matazero
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIARGS...\fR]
.br
.B mata
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIARGS...\fR]
.br
.B imgint
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fIOPTIONS\fR] [\fIARGS...\fR]

.SH DESCRIPTION
.B matazero
is a courtroom-grade, offline-first digital image forensics and ethical open-source intelligence (OSINT) analysis suite. It implements a 7-tier extraction pipeline to inspect image container structures, hardware encoder quantization tables (DQT/DHT), embedded payloads, chronological timelines, spatial reverse-geocoding, steganography, JPEG ghost slicing, CFA Bayer demosaicing artifacts, copy-move cloning, and local Ollama-based AI vision examination.

The tool operates strictly air-gapped with zero telemetry and contains hardcoded refusal logic against biometric facial recognition and bulk scraping.

.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B doctor
Run system health and diagnostic checks across all forensic engines, sandboxed workers, Ollama, and storage.
.TP
.B scan \fITARGET\fR
Smart 1-command evidence auto-triage with live progress bars and interactive HTML Case Dossier generation.
.TP
.B analyze \fITARGETS...\fR
Run 7 forensic extraction tiers over image files or directories.
.TP
.B ask \fITARGET QUESTION\fR
Interrogate an evidence image using your local Ollama vision model (100% offline).
.TP
.B model list
Discover and inspect local vision models available in your Ollama daemon.
.TP
.B diff \fIIMAGE1 IMAGE2\fR
Forensic comparison between two images (structural units, metadata delta, DQT tables, and pixel SSIM).
.TP
.B stego \fITARGET\fR
Deep steganography analysis, multi-channel bitplane slicing (planes 0-7), and Chi-Square Pair-of-Values test.
.TP
.B timeline \fITARGETS...\fR
Reconstruct chronological timelines across multiple files with camera clock drift estimation and Plaso/Timesketch export.
.TP
.B motion \fITARGET\fR
Detect and carve embedded MP4/HEVC video streams from Motion and Live Photos (Samsung, Pixel, Apple).
.TP
.B cluster \fITARGETS...\fR
Group evidence files by camera fleet, DQT quantization tables, GPS proximity, or visual similarity, with anomaly/outlier triage.
.TP
.B export \fITARGETS...\fR
Export forensic findings to a relational SQLite database or STIX 2.1 Threat Intelligence Bundle.
.TP
.B locate \fITARGETS...\fR
Forensic geolocation, reverse geocoding, NOAA solar chronolocation, and Leaflet/GeoJSON/GPX map export.
.TP
.B extract \fITARGET\fR
Extract embedded thumbnails, preview streams, metadata blocks, and trailing payloads.
.TP
.B probe \fITARGET\fR
Dump container segment and chunk structure with absolute byte offsets.
.TP
.B clean \fITARGET\fR
Losslessly strip metadata while preserving raw pixel streams.
.TP
.B scope \fI[create|validate|show]\fR
Manage cryptographically signed HMAC-SHA256 authorization scopes for chain-of-custody.
.TP
.B skill \fI[list|info]\fR
Manage and inspect dynamically loaded external forensic skills and microkernel plugins.
.TP
.B audit \fI[verify|export]\fR
Verify the tamper-evident SHA-256 hash-chained audit log.
.TP
.B corpus \fI[list|learn|info]\fR
Manage and train reference camera encoder quantization fingerprints.

.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-s ", " \-\-scope " \fIPATH\fR"
Path to authorization scope JSON file for legal chain-of-custody.
.TP
.BR \-a ", " \-\-self\-audit
Operate in self-audit mode on personal files without an external scope.
.TP
.BR \-t ", " \-\-tiers " \fILIST\fR"
Comma-separated tier list to execute (e.g. \fB1,2,3,4,7\fR).
.TP
.BR \-f ", " \-\-format " \fIFORMAT\fR"
Output format: \fBreport\fR, \fBdashboard\fR, \fBdeep\fR, \fBsummary\fR, \fBtext\fR, \fBjson\fR, \fBndjson\fR, \fBtable\fR, \fBhtml\fR, \fBgeojson\fR, \fBgpx\fR.
.TP
.BR \-o ", " \-\-out " \fIPATH\fR"
Write output to specified file path instead of standard output.
.TP
.BR \-r ", " \-\-recursive
Recursively search directories for image evidence files.
.TP
.BR \-j ", " \-\-jobs " \fINUM\fR"
Number of concurrent worker threads (default: 1).
.TP
.BR \-c ", " \-\-carve
Automatically carve trailing archives, payloads, and embedded video streams.
.TP
.BR \-\-ollama " \fIMODEL\fR"
Enable local Ollama vision model inspection in Tier 7 (e.g. \fBllama3.2-vision\fR, \fBmoondream\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-deep ", " \-\-details
Display exhaustive hierarchical forensic tree breakdown.
.TP
.BR \-\-summary
Display executive visual summary dashboard.
.TP
.BR \-\-filter " \fIEXPR\fR"
Filter records by condition (e.g. \fBhas_gps\fR, \fBhas_payload\fR, \fBauthentic=false\fR).
.TP
.BR \-\-version
Show program version and exit.
.TP
.BR \-\-help
Show help message and exit.

.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success: Analysis completed cleanly.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime Error: Unhandled execution exception.
.TP
.B 2
Usage Error: Invalid CLI flags or syntax.
.TP
.B 3
Unsupported Format: Magic bytes not recognized.
.TP
.B 4
Partial Success: Completed with non-fatal diagnostics.
.TP
.B 5
Budget Exceeded: Resource, unit count, or depth safety limit exceeded.
.TP
.B 6
Authorization Failure: Missing, invalid, or expired authorization scope.
.TP
.B 7
Custody Failure: Evidence hash mismatch or broken audit hash chain.

.SH FORENSIC STANDARDS & GUARANTEES
.TP
.B 100% Offline & Air-Gapped
Zero telemetry, zero external network queries, and evidence never leaves the local host.
.TP
.B Zero Biometric Surveillance
Refuses facial recognition, bulk scraping, or identity profiling.
.TP
.B Cryptographic Chain-of-Custody
SHA-256 hash-chained audit logging and HMAC-SHA256 signed legal authorization scopes.
.TP
.B Deterministic Verdicts
Outputs verifiable authenticity ratings (\fBAUTHENTIC_CAMERA_CAPTURE\fR, \fBTAMPERED_TRAILING_PAYLOAD\fR, \fBAI_SYNTHETIC_GENERATION\fR, \fBUNVERIFIED_METADATA_STRIPPED\fR) with mandatory confidence ratings and caveats.

.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B 1. Full 7-tier deep forensic analysis:
matazero analyze evidence.jpg \-a \-\-deep
.TP
.B 2. Interrogate evidence with local Ollama vision AI:
matazero ask crime_scene.jpg "What make and model is that vehicle?"
.TP
.B 3. Compare two images for tampering and pixel SSIM delta:
matazero diff original.jpg suspect.jpg \-f table
.TP
.B 4. Inspect LSB bitplanes and Chi-Square steganography:
matazero stego suspect.png \-f table
.TP
.B 5. Cluster 10,000 photos by camera fleet and detect outliers:
matazero cluster ./evidence_vault/ \-a \-r \-k camera \-\-outliers
.TP
.B 6. Export case evidence to relational SQLite:
matazero export ./case_evidence \-a \-r \-t sqlite \-o case.db
.TP
.B 7. Reconstruct case timeline and estimate camera clock drift:
matazero timeline ./case_photos \-a \-r \-f plaso \-o timeline.jsonl

